#: model:ir.model.fields,help:fitness_subscriptions.field_product_template__fitness_is_subscription_plan
msgid ""
"Enable for recurring fitness plans. Activates weekly-allowance tracking "
"on the subscription (sale.order)."
msgstr ""
"Actívalo en los planes de fitness recurrentes. Activa el seguimiento del "
"cupo semanal en la suscripción (sale.order)."

