#: code:addons/fitness_subscriptions/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"No weekly hour reserved for %(which)s yet. Placement will book nothing "
"for it. Set her slot, then click Place Classes."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no hay hora semanal reservada para %(which)s. La colocación no "
"reservará nada. Fija su hora y pulsa Colocar clases."

#. module: fitness_subscriptions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/fitness_subscriptions/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"No weekly hour reserved yet. She is paying for %(count)s reserved "
"class(es) a week and none is set, so placement will book nothing. Set her "
"slot, then click Place Classes."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no hay hora semanal reservada. Está pagando %(count)s clase(s) "
"fija(s) a la semana y no hay ninguna fijada, así que la colocación no "
"reservará nada. Fija su hora y pulsa Colocar clases."

